 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;a href="https://oss.nextdoor.com/veneer/docs/reference/metrics/#decision-metrics">&lt;code>veneer_decision_total&lt;/code>&lt;/a>&lt;/td>
